(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Array Fundamentals in C, detailing contiguous memory allocation, zero-based indexing, and address calculation formulas.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Array Fundamentals and Memory Architecture in C:) Tj
T*
(   1. Definition and Physical Properties:) Tj
T*
(   - An array is a collection of homogeneous data elements stored in contiguous \(adjacent\)) Tj
T*
(   physical memory addresses in RAM.) Tj
T*
(   - Homogeneity: Every element has the exact same data type and byte footprint \(e.g., all 4-byte) Tj
T*
(   integers or all 8-byte doubles\).) Tj
T*
(   - Fixed Size: The array capacity is fixed at declaration time \(except for dynamic heap arrays\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Zero-Based Indexing Mechanics:) Tj
T*
(   - In C, arrays are strictly 0-indexed \(indices range from 0 to N-1 for an array of size N\).) Tj
T*
(   - Architectural Origin: The array identifier represents the Base Memory Address of the entire) Tj
T*
(   structure.) Tj
T*
(   - The index 'i' represents the physical displacement \(offset\) from the base address in element) Tj
T*
(   units.) Tj
T*
(   - Index 0 represents zero displacement: element 0 resides directly at the base address!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Memory Address Calculation Formula:) Tj
T*
(   Address\(arr[i]\) = BaseAddress + \(i * sizeof\(DataType\)\)) Tj
T*
(   - Example Calculation:) Tj
T*
(   Given: double gene_scores[100];) Tj
T*
(   Let BaseAddress = 0x2000; sizeof\(double\) = 8 bytes.) Tj
T*
(   Address of gene_scores[5] = 0x2000 + \(5 * 8\) = 0x2000 + 40 = 0x2028.) Tj
T*
(   Constant-Time Access: Because the address is computed via a single multiply-add machine) Tj
T*
(   instruction, accessing any arbitrary index arr[i] executes in O\(1\) time!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Demonstrative ANSI C Program:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   int dataset[5] = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50};) Tj
T*
(   uintptr_t base = \(uintptr_t\)dataset;) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   printf\("=== Contiguous Memory Layout Inspection ===\\n"\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Base Address: %p\\n", \(void *\)dataset\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   for \(int i = 0; i < 5; i++\) {) Tj
T*
(   uintptr_t actual_addr = \(uintptr_t\)&dataset[i];) Tj
T*
(   uintptr_t calculated_addr = base + \(i * sizeof\(int\)\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Index [%d] -> Val: %2d | Addr: %p | Calculated: 0x%lx | Match: %s\\n",) Tj
T*
(   i, dataset[i], \(void *\)&dataset[i], \(unsigned long\)calculated_addr,) Tj
T*
(   \(actual_addr == calculated_addr\) ? "YES" : "NO"\);) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   return 0;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
