() Tj
T*
(   3. Cache Locality Consideration:) Tj
T*
(   In the standard loop order \(i, j, k\), elements of B[k][j] are accessed with a stride of COLS_B) Tj
T*
(   \(column-wise\), causing frequent CPU cache line misses. Reordering loops to \(i, k, j\) accesses) Tj
T*
(   both A and B with stride-1 \(row-wise\), accelerating execution by 3x-5x on modern CPUs!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Complete ANSI C Source Code:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   #define M 2) Tj
T*
(   #define K 3) Tj
T*
