T*
(   A single-pass naive formula \(Sum\(x^2\) - \(Sum\(x\)^2\)/N\) suffers from catastrophic cancellation in) Tj
T*
(   floating-point arithmetic. A two-pass approach computing mean first is numerically stable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
