(   [Problem Statement]: Write an ANSI C program to verify whether a square matrix is Symmetric, Skew-Symmetric, or Asymmetric.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Matrix Symmetry Classification in C:) Tj
T*
(   1. Definitions:) Tj
T*
(   For square matrix M of dimension N x N:) Tj
T*
(   - Symmetric: M[i][j] == M[j][i] for all i, j.) Tj
T*
(   - Skew-Symmetric: M[i][j] == -M[j][i] for all i, j, AND all main diagonal elements M[i][i] ==) Tj
T*
(   0.) Tj
T*
(   - Asymmetric: Satisfies neither condition.) Tj
