T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Boyer-Moore Majority Voting Algorithm:) Tj
T*
(   1. Definition:) Tj
T*
(   A majority element in an array of size N is an element that appears strictly more than N/2) Tj
T*
(   times.) Tj
