() Tj
T*
(   2. Algorithmic Principle:) Tj
T*
(   - Maintains a 'candidate' element and a 'counter'.) Tj
T*
(   - If counter == 0, pick current element as candidate and set counter = 1.) Tj
T*
(   - If current element matches candidate, increment counter \(counter++\).) Tj
T*
(   - If current element differs from candidate, decrement counter \(counter--\).) Tj
T*
(   - Core Intuition: Different elements cancel each other out. If a majority element exists \(>) Tj
T*
(   N/2\), its instances will outlast all other elements combined!) Tj
T*
(   - Verification Pass: Make a second pass to confirm candidate count > N/2.) Tj
T*
() Tj
