(   [Problem Statement]: Write an ANSI C program to find the second largest element in an array in a single traversal pass in O\(N\) time.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Single-Pass Second Largest Element Finder:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Statement:) Tj
T*
(   Find the second distinct largest element in an unsorted integer array in a single traversal) Tj
T*
(   pass \(O\(N\) time and O\(1\) space\).) Tj
T*
(   Sorting requires O\(N log N\) time; naive two-pass requires scanning the array twice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Algorithmic Logic:) Tj
T*
(   Maintain two registers: 'largest' and 'second_largest'.) Tj
T*
(   Traverse array:) Tj
T*
(   - If arr[i] > largest: update second_largest = largest, then largest = arr[i].) Tj
T*
(   - Else if arr[i] > second_largest and arr[i] != largest: update second_largest = arr[i].) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Complete ANSI C Source Code:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
(   #include <limits.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int find_second_largest\(const int *arr, int n\) {) Tj
T*
(   if \(n < 2\) return INT_MIN;) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int largest = INT_MIN;) Tj
T*
(   int second_largest = INT_MIN;) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   for \(int i = 0; i < n; i++\) {) Tj
T*
(   if \(arr[i] > largest\) {) Tj
T*
(   second_largest = largest;) Tj
T*
(   largest = arr[i];) Tj
T*
(   } else if \(arr[i] > second_largest && arr[i] != largest\) {) Tj
T*
(   second_largest = arr[i];) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   return second_largest;) Tj
T*
